{
    "title": "Escape Run: Endless Die Fun",
    "description": "Don't smash your phone while you are playing Escape Run: Endless Die Fun, a fun challenging platform game that will push your skills to the limit.\r\n\r\nYour objective is dash to the exit, all while passing all the traps and obstacles. Expect the unexpected - treacherous pits erupt from nowhere, spikes lurk with murderous intent, and ceilings threaten to crush you. \r\n\r\nWhy Escape Run: Endless Die Fun?\r\n- 100 levels that are impossible to pass all.\r\n- Easy to play but hard to master\r\n- Simple but beautiful graphics that will make your heart sing\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n- Use arrow keys or touchscreen controls to move your character. Navigate through platforming levels.\r\n- Jump over gaps and hazards.\r\n- Watch out spikes, pits, and other obstacles that can make you lose.\r\n- Reach the end of the adventure devil level\r\n\r\nRemember, while it is a challenging adventure game, find it rewarding to conquer! Goodluck to you and not die again",
    "descriptionHTML": "Don&#39;t smash your phone while you are playing Escape Run: Endless Die Fun, a fun challenging platform game that will push your skills to the limit.<br><br>Your objective is dash to the exit, all while passing all the traps and obstacles. Expect the unexpected - treacherous pits erupt from nowhere, spikes lurk with murderous intent, and ceilings threaten to crush you. <br><br>Why Escape Run: Endless Die Fun?<br>- 100 levels that are impossible to pass all.<br>- Easy to play but hard to master<br>- Simple but beautiful graphics that will make your heart sing<br><br>How to play:<br>- Use arrow keys or touchscreen controls to move your character. Navigate through platforming levels.<br>- Jump over gaps and hazards.<br>- Watch out spikes, pits, and other obstacles that can make you lose.<br>- Reach the end of the adventure devil level<br><br>Remember, while it is a challenging adventure game, find it rewarding to conquer! Goodluck to you and not die again",
